   "stem_html": "A major difference between Andrew Jackson and Henry Clay in their arguments regarding the Bank of the United States concerned",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1169568,
     "content_html": "the fact that the bank dealt only with the elite"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169569,
     "content_html": "the constitutionality of the bank"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169567,
     "content_html": "Clay’s belief that the veto should be used liberally"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169566,
     "content_html": "the extent of the president’s power over the bank"
    }
   ],
